From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kai Ninomiya <kainino@chromium.org>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 11:23:23 -0700
Subject: [M153] Add missing validation to copyExternalImageToTexture

Original change's description:
> Add missing validation to copyExternalImageToTexture
>
> copyExternalImageToTexture would ignore certain errors in
> CreateExternalTexture (via CopyFromVideoElement which was incorrectly
> pretending to be infallible).
>
> Refactor several error-prone patterns so this is easier to do correctly
> in the future.
>
> Fixed: 560062638
> Change-Id: I321c3a4256f8a14d4ddd505da2afb3f25ece7fab
> Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8415995
> Reviewed-by: Brandon Jones <bajones@chromium.org>
> Commit-Queue: Kai Ninomiya <kainino@chromium.org>
> Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1699109}

(cherry picked from commit 8f0b2682984207138b06e0a90c962e34376b89d1)

Fixed: 562783667
Bug: 560062638
Change-Id: I321c3a4256f8a14d4ddd505da2afb3f25ece7fab
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8427487
Commit-Queue: Kai Ninomiya <kainino@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Brandon Jones <bajones@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/branch-heads/8010@{#1619}
Cr-Branched-From: 86cee6df69e0463a839c0cc8435c9d4c259434d3-refs/heads/main@{#1681091}

Electron adaptation notes (44-x-y):
Taken from the M153 merge (CL 8427487) instead of the main CL because main
had already moved to the LeaseSharedImage API. external_texture_helper.cc:
this branch passes shared_image_wrapper->GetSyncToken() where M153 has a
local sync_token; that call is kept and the new null-check on
mailbox_texture follows it.

